1154 0 obj
  << /ActualText (I started as an intern at the Star Tribune before being hired on full\055time by the end of that summer\056 Throughout the years here\054 my role has been flexible\054 allowing me to grow in many areas beyond my job title\056 Throughout my tenure at the Star Tribune\054 I have\072\nPitched and developed visual storytelling\054 owning the project from reporting\054 to coding\054 to publication\nCollaborated with reporters and editors to find creative visual solutions for stories without traditional assets\nUsed front\055end development skills to build bespoke article displays for our enterprise journalism\nLearned new languages\054 such as Svelte\054 that allowed for the creation of reusable code components\nCreated and standardized templates for our off\055platform content to ensure clean design and brand recognition\054 no matter where readers come across our work\nTrained our audience team on best practices and workflows for the off\055platform templates\nServed as a mentor for interns\054 helping to develop their careers and create a portfolio site to showcase their work)
     /K [ 9 ]
     /P 1155 0 R
     /Pg 1136 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

