1172 0 obj
  << /ActualText (I teach a Media Design Studio class\054 three times a week\054 for students at the University of St\056 Thomas\056 Throughout the course of the semester\054 I guide students on\072 \nCreating a portfolio website using Github Pages and the Bootstrap framework\nBuilding familiarity with HTML \046 CSS and using front\055end development skills to customize pre\055existing components\nCreating work for professional clients\054 with multiple feedback and iteration rounds\nDeveloping a muscle for creativity and inspiration\054 and keeping it strong through consistent training\nLearning to receive and provide helpful critiques\n\n)
     /K [ 18 ]
     /P 1173 0 R
     /Pg 1136 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

